# Learned runtime state — the framework is the repo, the trained state is
# data. Skills regrow through use (the trained-snapshot tag preserves the
# pre-reset store); the registry DBs were always ignored via *.db.
# ANCHORED to the repo root on purpose: the unanchored form `skills/`
# also matched `src/skills/` and silently kept five SOURCE modules
# (abi, compilePrompt, lifecycle, stats, events) out of every commit —
# the remote was unbuildable and local git status showed clean.
/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json
# Pre-consolidation ledger; the ledger is now a table in the store (*.db
# above). Kept ignored: an old checkout or the one-shot importer can still
# leave one, and `.bak` variants were committed by accident once.
atoma-ledger.jsonl*
# Pre-consolidation prefilter cache; it is now a `prefilter_cache` table in
# the store. Kept ignored so an old checkout cannot commit one.
atoma-prefilter-cache.json
